{"ID":"20240513083159-jfkz9c3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083159-jfkz9c3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083159-jfkz9c3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151126-o5gfoit\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151126-o5gfoit\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151126-o5gfoit\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:602,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:619\u0026#125;","title":"180","type":"doc","updated":"20240514140215"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513151126-o5gfoit","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 941px;","id":"20240513151126-o5gfoit","updated":"20240514140215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/05"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"156-3 C, CH"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1975(33) / 中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/21"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 胃中有水感，偶爾會有。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 服藥後胃有點反胃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 右乳時抽痛偶然一二下，左乳也會。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. “喘”已無。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不易出，一天一次，無便意。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3. 足溫："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4. 口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴有，溫飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5. 胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃不多"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6. 精神："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"體力好轉，眼皮輕很多。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 舌苔眼皮重→脾濕比較盛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7. 睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8. 月經："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5/16月經該來，至今未來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9. 寒熱："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡時身無寒熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10. 其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無胸脹。 不喜歡吃冰的。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩；細小無力"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃紅；牙痕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 腸胃虛 故血不足 以至經未來"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子二錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→患者腳寒冷，胃裡面有水感。前方用排水的藥，輕劑仍推不動 ，代表此為 “寒水”停在裡面很久了，故腳還是冷的。 “胃為腎之關”胃口減及胃內停水有噁心的現象，與腎亦有 相關性。所以腎衰竭病人會噁心想吐，東西吃不下，食即作 吐，胃不可受納。 故用“生附子”將裡寒水化掉。患者較嬌小故用二錢。 許多人一服四逆湯即月經至。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乾薑二錢  吳茱萸二錢  生薑兩片  炙甘草三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 胃寒；胃中停寒水 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮三錢  茯苓四錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" → 排濕 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒麥芽五錢  當歸二錢  川芎二錢  熟地二錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→四物湯加炒麥芽可治乳房硬塊或有多於奶水沉積乳房之症 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白芍五錢  茜草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"  → 經來悶痛，有血塊→活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳皮二錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"參付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9→3碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因脈症相合，脈細小在骨邊與症狀相合故開此方。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"月經未至解說"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“ 肝藏血，脾統血，心主血。”\n此案例月經未至是因為患者腸胃功能不是很好，還未完全恢復，故吸收的營養，土無法生金。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}